window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Light or Dark, those are your choices.</p> <p>Determining who is who is up to you!</p> <p>In the land of Hearth, Dalia struggles with the third-class citizenry of the Wild to survive! Life is harsh! However, they can run like the wind; a default for young Dalia when things get thick! Her gift of ‘the Knowing’ assists her family of the slum burrows.</p> <p>Lord Kaine:</p> <p>In Eden, the highest court in the Land, there's illness &amp; death; tormenting their Kings &amp; servantry below in Workfolk. The elite are dying young &amp; no more children have been birthed. That could be the Extinction of Hearth!</p> <p>There was a small glimmer of hope. If Kaine, the King’s son, could locate the offspring of a former leader, somewhere in the Wild; He or she could be key. He would send in the ruthless Guardians to locate the child, now grown.</p> <p>Lord Darius:</p> <p>Darius has found the 'missing link'. There she lay on the grassy knoll under a peach tree in the wood park. She wouldn’t see him coming. He would snake his way into her life like Lucifer. His lust was palpable. She was the hen that laid the Golden Eggs. Darius would steal her from dastardly Kaine. Then the King would perish &amp; Darius &amp; his father could restore the world to their rightful reign.</p> <p><i>Award-winning trilogy now comes to life with this bestselling author, Jesse Fox. You’ll be on the edge of your sofa with the binge-worthy, heart-pounding action. Emotions are just as intense as this detailed, HAWT, steamy romances &amp; bloody escapes that will have you, TORN. Reviewers say they laughed, cried, &amp; gasped as they listened. Start to finish, you'll never guess all your worst fears, even ones you didn’t think possible, would come to fruition. Thus, leaving you hung over, feeling all the feels with a satisfying HEA!</i></p> <p>Triggers/Dark Romance Tropes in this Romantasy.</p>"; 
